params.command:
$ErrorActionPreference='Stop'; $objective=@'
Reconcile fengie/mhw-mods to canonical origin/main. Execute branch cleanup: fetch/prune, inspect active worktrees/agent ownership, remove only non-active branches whose useful work is already on main or provably superseded, and use support agents to port/test any remaining useful unique work onto current main before removing completed task branches. Preserve the permanent heaven-bridge transport branch and never merge its queue/results history into main. Do not downgrade versions or overwrite current continuity state. Validate changes, push and verify main, clean temporary worktrees, and report final main SHA plus exact remaining remote branches. Goal: zero disposable branches.
'@; $b64=[Convert]::ToBase64String([Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetBytes($objective)); $candidates=@((Join-Path $HOME 'agent-control-panel\tools\agent-control\agentctl.mjs'),(Join-Path $HOME 'local-ai-workspaces\mhw-mods\tools\agent-control\agentctl.mjs')); $ctl=$candidates|Where-Object{Test-Path $_}|Select-Object -First 1; if(-not $ctl){throw 'agentctl.mjs not found'}; & node $ctl cycle --task-base64 $b64 --support 4 --priority 100; if($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0){throw ('agentctl cycle failed '+$LASTEXITCODE)}
